<div class="app">
  <header class="topbar">
    <%- partial('_partials/navbar') %>
  </header>
  <main class="workspace">
    <section class="visual" aria-label="人物关系图谱">
      <nav class="cluster-nav" id="group-mode" aria-label="关系图聚类方式">
        <button type="button" data-group="network" aria-pressed="true">全部关系</button>
        <button type="button" data-group="nationality" aria-pressed="false">按国家</button>
        <button type="button" data-group="organization" aria-pressed="false">按组织</button>
        <button type="button" data-group="pathway" aria-pressed="false">按途径</button>
      </nav>
      <canvas id="graph" aria-label="人物关系图。可拖动画布或人物，滚轮缩放；也可在侧栏搜索并选择人物。"></canvas>
      <div id="progression-preview" class="progression-preview" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
      <div class="graph-legend"><span><i></i> 人物</span><span title="粗细和明暗按两端人物的字面提及次数计算"> <i></i> 连线：人物提及次数</span></div>
      <div class="graph-controls" aria-label="图谱缩放控制"><button id="zoom-in" aria-label="放大">＋</button><button id="zoom-out" aria-label="缩小">−</button><button id="fit" aria-label="重置视图">⌾</button></div>
      <div class="canvas-hint">拖动画布移动 · 滚轮缩放 · 点击人物查看关系</div>
    </section>
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <div class="sidebar-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">人物图谱</span><h2>探索关系</h2></div><button id="reset" class="icon-button" title="清除选择" aria-label="清除选择">↺</button></div>
      <label class="searchbox"><span>⌕</span><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="搜索人物或别名…" aria-label="搜索人物或别名"><kbd>⌘ K</kbd></label>
      <div class="filter-row"><div><strong>显示孤立人物</strong><small>尚未收录关系的人物</small></div><label class="switch"><input id="isolates" type="checkbox"><span></span><span class="sr-only">显示孤立人物</span></label></div>
      <div class="side-stats"><span><b id="person-count"></b> 人物</span><span><b id="relation-count"></b> 关系</span><span id="visible-count"></span></div>
      <div id="palette-legend" class="palette-legend" aria-label="当前分类配色图例"></div>
      <div id="content" class="content"></div>
      <footer>非官方同人项目 · 人物关系持续整理中<br>提及次数为字面匹配，可能存在重名与遗漏<br>内容涉及《诡秘之主》及《宿命之环》剧透</footer>
    </aside>
  </main>
</div>
